  "summary": "Updates the 2024 framework with risk grading, derivative social risks and new measures. It adds open-source ecosystem security duties, end-use controls for CBRN and missile scenarios, and developer testing for loss-of-control risk.",
  "quote": "确保人工智能始终处于人类控制之下",
