     "quote": "支持人工智能开源社区建设，促进模型、工具、数据集等汇聚开放，培育优质开源项目。",
     "url": "https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/202508/content_7037861.htm",
     "quoteEn": "Support building AI open-source communities, promote the pooling and opening of models, tools, datasets and the like, and cultivate high-quality open-source projects."
